title: Minor Reggae in Twelve
key: Am
tempo: 72
meter: 12/8
style: reggae

// A minor reggae with a shuffle under it: four slow pulses to the bar, three
// eighths in each. An eight-bar verse that walks down from the one through the
// flat seven and the flat six and back, closing on the major five; an eight-bar
// chorus that rocks between the four and the one, climbs through the flat six
// and the flat seven, and turns home on the five in the drop's half of the bar.
[Verse]
| Am | G | F | G  |
| Am | G | F | E7 |

[Chorus]
| Dm | Am | Dm    | Am |
| F  | G  | Am E7 | Am |

[Verse]

[Chorus]
